{"shortDescription":"Spot premiums for Asia's very low sulphur fuel oil (VLSFO) market extended declines on Friday, while high sulphur fuel oil (HSFO) steadied from previous falls in the week.Softer offers for VLSFO emerged for October loading dates, weighing further on the Singapore cash differential. Prompt intermont…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Spot premiums for Asia's very low sulphur fuel oil (VLSFO) market extended declines on Friday, while high sulphur fuel oil (HSFO) steadied from previous falls in the week."]},{"type":"p","children":["Softer offers for VLSFO emerged for October loading dates, weighing further on the Singapore cash differential. Prompt intermonth spreads also narrowed day-on-day."]},{"type":"p","children":["Meanwhile, the 380-cst HSFO market saw a trade emerging at a relatively firmer premium versus the previous session, though the benchmark differential held largely rangebound due to a narrow gap between bids and offers."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cracks for both key grades softened on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["VLSFO's October crack (LFO05SGBRTCMc1) closed at a premium near $22 a barrel, while 380-cst HSFO's crack (FO380BRTCKMc1) dipped to a discount of about $4.25 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["The October hi-five spread (FO05-380SGMc1) logged a weekly increase, closing at above $166 a metric ton."]},{"type":"p","children":["INVENTORY DATA"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Fuel oil inventories in the Amsterdam-Rotterdam-Antwerp (ARA) hub (STK-FO-ARA) dipped 1.6% to 858,000 tons in the week to September 17, according to Dutch consultancy Insights Global."]},{"type":"p","children":["OTHER NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Oil prices fell 2% on Friday, extending losses for a third straight session, as easing concerns over Saudi supply disruptions outweighed anxiety about a widening Middle East conflict."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Saudi Arabia has sold about 60 million barrels of crude from its Ras Tanura port inside the Strait of Hormuz for loading via ship-to-ship transfer at the Omani port of Sohar this month and next, trade sources said on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Four commodity vessels transited the Strait of Hormuz in the Gulf on Thursday, down from six a day earlier and below the 10-day average of about 16, preliminary shipping data showed on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Russia's Slavneft Yaroslavnefteorgsintez (YANOS) oil refinery halted crude processing on Thursday following a Ukrainian drone attack that damaged equipment at the facility, four industry sources told Reuters."]},{"type":"p","children":["WINDOW TRADES"]},{"type":"p","children":["- 180-cst HSFO: No trade."]},{"type":"p","children":["- 380-cst HSFO: Two trades."]},{"type":"p","children":["- 0.5% VLSFO: No trade."]},{"type":"p","children":["ASSESSMENTS"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["FUEL OIL"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CASH ($/T)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ASIA CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CHANGE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["PREV CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["RIC"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Cargo - 180cst"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["655.92"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["-18.79"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["674.71"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell",